Output docs/assets/terminal-review.gif
Require node
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1120
Set Height 500
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 15
Set TypingSpeed 24ms
Hide
Type "sh scripts/demo/terminal.sh"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 1s
Down 2
Type "v"
Right 36
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "c"
Type "Also test clearing the query with Escape."
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
